abstract: >
  HSRI 2.0: The Sovereignty Sentinel & ASI Precursor Seismograph.
  Formalizes the Dual-Layer Architecture (Layer 1 Adoption Baseline vs. Layer 2 ASI Sovereignty Leontief Floor beta=0.5),
  the Verification Latency Wedge Accelerometer, the Cognitive Oversight Richter Scale (CORS 1.0-10.0), and three continuous
  telemetry precursor streams (Autonomy Seismometer, Latent Drift Detector, Verification Wedge).
  Synthesizes 780 macro observations across 39 benchmark nations exposing High-Compute Vulnerability Traps, JRC Step 7
  Monte Carlo audits (W=0.9986), psychometric CFA validation, and 14 observable ASI precursor tripwires.
